# Overlay series fragment kit: applied after atlas/patches/series and the fragments before it
# (file-name order). Owner: ATLAS-UI (the Kit chrome, ADR 0062). One entry per line, a path under atlas/patches.
# atlas-series refuses a patch listed twice and a patch number used twice, and warns when a number
# is outside this range:
# range: 0100-0119
ui/0100-kit-chrome-hooks.patch
ui/0101-kit-app-menu.patch
ui/0102-kit-context-menu.patch
ui/0103-kit-downloads.patch
ui/0104-kit-layout-provider.patch
ui/0105-default-system-theme.patch
ui/0106-kit-sidebar-pane.patch
